{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12901","headline":"送端州冯使君 · 韩翃","name":"送端州冯使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白皙风流似有须，一门豪贵领苍梧。\n三峰亭暗橘边宿，八桂林香节下趋。\n玉树羣儿争翠羽，金盘少妾拣明珠。\n怀君乐事不可见，騣马翩翩新虎符。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}